-- The mixfix rule for mixfix-input-named-like-word-import.l4, in a file of its own.
-- The calls are written head first: main's exact-printer reorders an infix
-- mixfix call (smucclaw/l4-ide#918, fixed on unstable), which the .ep.golden
-- would then record.
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
a `plus` b MEANS a + b

#EVAL `plus` 3 4    -- 7
